{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_209_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_209","textTraditional":"一、二十有九年。春，公至自乾侯，居于運。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_209_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_209","textTraditional":"二、齊侯使高張來唁公。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_209_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_209","textTraditional":"三、公如晉，次于乾侯。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_209_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_209","textTraditional":"四、夏四月庚子，叔倪卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_209_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_209","textTraditional":"五、秋七月。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_209_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_209","textTraditional":"六、冬十月，運潰。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_209_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_209","textTraditional":"邑不言潰，此其言潰何？郛之也。曷為郛之？君存焉爾。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}